<!-- This list field orders the CORE members only (always present, so no absence hazard); sub-plugin members pin themselves via list-before/list-after — an absent sub-plugin is an inert pin, and the natural fallback equals the old degraded order. -->
list: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/view-placement/action $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/view-placement/project
title: $:/tags/hypergsd/ViewPlacement

<!-- Tag list for view placement. One member per GSD type: hgsd-type-tag is the type tag the view renders on, list = body templates in transclusion order, hgsd-config names the leaf under $:/config/hypergsd/Placement/, hgsd-default (top/bottom) applies while that config is unset. The view-body-top/-bottom hooks loop this tag list — no hook names a plugin, an absent sub-plugin is simply a shorter tag list; the Settings "View placement" tab renders one Top/Bottom radio pair per member (caption = lingo transclusion). Ordering: the list field above (core members), member pins, then alphabetical; the references member's empty list-after (move-to-end) sorts it after later third-party members — a user's drag deletes the pin and takes over. -->